  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 18 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D19"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the heparin sodium shortage on 2017-11-14 and it remains Current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E91"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage has been on FDA's list for 107 months.",
      "cites": ["D26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show multiple inspections of plants on our product labels with OAI classifications in the three years before the posting, including an OAI inspection ending 2016-10-03 (407 days before posting) and another ending 2016-06-08 (524 days before posting).",
      "cites": ["D17", "D16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A VAI inspection ended 2017-10-27, just 18 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued 2017-02-14, 273 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from BE Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D27"]
    }
  ]
